get.description:
Upgrades the connection to WebSocket. Pulse events are broadcast automatically. For chat events, send JSON messages to subscribe or unsubscribe from thread topics.

Subscribe payload: { "action": "chat.subscribe", "threadId": "<uuid>", "token": "<jwt>" }
Unsubscribe payload: { "action": "chat.unsubscribe", "threadId": "<uuid>" }

Server acknowledgements: chat.subscribed, chat.unsubscribed, chat.error. Chat messages are published as event: message.created.
